    "descriptionHtml": "Hi peeps! I&#39;m @dave.xp and I can&#39;t wait for you to make your own portraits!<br><br>Me and the developer team have carefully crafted this app so you can make the cutest looking avatars on the internet!<br><br>It&#39;s very easy to use and you&#39;ll get the most beautiful results by just picking your favourite items out of 14 different categories. <br><br>With many different items to choose from and their color variations, you can make thousands of unique combinations and I can&#39;t wait to see yours!<br><br>Tag your portraits with the hashtag #dollifyapp and I&#39;ll be featuring some of them every week on my Instagram account! <br><br>Cheers<br>Dave XP",
